<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
  </head>
  <body>
<p>
  Your statement has been published: <a href="{{env.WEBSITE_URL}}/{{letter.slug}}">{{letter.title}}</a>.
</p>
<p>
  To post an update, click on the button below
</p>
<p>
  <center>
    <a href="{{env.WEBSITE_URL}}/{{letter.slug}}/update?token={{letter.token}}" style="text-decoration: none;display:inline-block;width:220px;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; background: #111; color: white; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; box-sizing: border-box;">
      Post an update
    </a>
  </center>
</p>
<p>
  To permanently delete this statement, click on this link: <a href="{{env.WEBSITE_URL}}/{{letter.slug}}/delete?token={{letter.token}}">remove this statement</a>.
</p>

<h3>Important notes ☝️</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Anyone with this email can permanently delete the statement or post an update, so be cautious before forwarding it!</li>
  <li>Only the people who signed and opted in to receive updates will be notified when you post an update.</li>
  <li>Privacy notice: <a href="{{env.PRIVACY_URL}}">{{env.PRIVACY_URL}}</a></li>
</ul>
</body>
</html>
